      "title": "Sonos Inc.",
      "fund": "Substack / BlackOpal Research Limited",
      "date": "January 13, 2023",
      "summary": "BlackOpal Research conducts a fundamental evaluation of Sonos' high-margin business model, noting that 44% of annual product sales come from existing households expanding their system setups. Despite its 2,000+ patent portfolio and strong ecosystem stickiness, the analysis cautions against high stock-based compensation (~5% annual dilution) and cyclical consumer risk, estimating an intrinsic value of ~$7.88.",
