      "title": "BSD Elevator Pitches: Sonos Inc. ($SONO)",
      "fund": "Buyside Digest / BSD Elevator Pitches",
      "date": "Q4 2021",
      "summary": "The write-up outlines a core institutional long thesis on Sonos, arguing that the market mispriced the company as a lumpy commodity hardware vendor vulnerable to big tech loss leaders. Instead, the author emphasizes Sonos' moat in premium home theater where tech giants do not compete, high multi-device household retention, and strong free cash flow conversion.",
